{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-corrected-markov-trace","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:corrected-markov-trace","kind":"proposition","title":"Markov trace of $\\sigma_0\\sigma_1\\sigma_0$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/thm-jones-markov-trace"],"cites":["references/jones1987"],"tags":["markov-trace","correction","hopf-link","yang-baxter","adjacent-generators"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.ParticleInteractions.corrected_markov_trace","text":"corrected-markov-trace.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:corrected-markov-trace\"></a><p>The Markov trace of the braid word <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\sigma_0 \\sigma_1 \\sigma_0</code> (whose closure is the Hopf link) is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">hz^2 + z</code>, not <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z^3</code>. The value <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z^3</code> comes from applying the Markov property to a generator that is not of maximal index, which the property does not allow.</p>\n<h2>Statement</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\mathrm{tr}_M(\\sigma_0 \\sigma_1 \\sigma_0) = h z^2 + z</code></pre>\n<p><em>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">z = \\mathrm{tr}_M(\\sigma_0)</code> is the Markov parameter\nand <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h = q - q^{-1}</code>.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/corrected-markov-trace.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"13.4.18","page":"b/prop-corrected-markov-trace","qa":{"counts":{"pass":89,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":12,"unknown":0,"stale":75},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:HeckeTemperleyLieb.corrected_markov_trace","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/HeckeTemperleyLieb/corrected_markov_trace.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
